5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited for the new season! I want to see where our money actually goes. I'll check the loan transport costs and mount-making charges.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about our capacity. I will look into the conservation lab staffing and the composition of the volunteer roster.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,We need to know what actually draws a crowd. I'll examine the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The physical limits of the gallery are paramount. I'll review the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the logistics of getting things here. I shall look into the lender paperwork and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
