30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, transport costs are huge! Almost a third of installation costs. But we can save on mounts if objects come with their own supports.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Victoria,,It's worse than I thought. The lab is down to one person with a massive backlog. We can't handle a lot of new conservation work.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shion,,Interesting. People love mechanisms and live presence. Static cases are boring; they want to see someone working or something moving.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and evening hires mean we can't have fragile, open arrangements that can't be moved or closed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Paperwork delays have actually pushed back openings before. Also, powered displays are a nightmare to maintain and often break during hours.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if the lab is that full, we should avoid anything that needs a lot of cleaning or stabilizing, right?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Exactly, Mio. Any proposal requiring heavy conservation intervention is a risk to the timeline and the staff.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, if we want high attendance, we need movement, but I assume that clashes with your structural and hire concerns?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"Likely. Heavy kinetic art might exceed the bay's limit, and open displays are vulnerable during catering events.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, please be careful with ""movement."" The maintenance logs show powered displays often fail, leaving us with roped-off sections.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,"So we need something that is budget-friendly, doesn't stress the lab, and isn't too heavy or fragile.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"And we should consider if our volunteers, mostly town historians, can actually support the exhibition's needs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shion,,"If we want the public to return, we need a ""human"" element or a dynamic display, despite the maintenance risks.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Asuka,,We must prioritize the building's integrity and the schedule. No oversized stonework or permanent open-air setups.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let's ensure the loan process is simple to avoid those shipping cut-off disasters.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready to see the candidates!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Shion,,Let's see if any of these fit the data.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will judge them based on the constraints.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I look forward to it.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
